reat. Seems to be a mobile port but I haven't checked so don't quote me on that. It would deserve to be a free flash game/free mobile game, not a three dollar steam game (I did get it for 30 cents however.) Confusing to say the least, you have no real point of interest you just buy stuff and move around to sell stuff where it will sell for higher than you bought it. Mercs seem to do nothing as bandits still take my money even though I have mercs hired. Diamonds seem to be a freemium element but yet there doesn't seem to be a way to buy them (maybe on the mobile verison if it is indeed a mobile port.) It costs me 20 gold to go over a toll bridge but yet some reason they take 200? Usually end up getting screwed by just traveling seeing as how toll bridges take 10 times more than they say.\n\nAlso as everyone has said, where is the 16 bit graphics? Devs claimed it wasn't a play on graphics but a play on an amiga title and since this is supposed to be some sort of \"spiritual sequal\" they just doubled the bits as a joke I guess? Yet this is quoted from the description \"Great graphics with an old-school 16-bit vibe.\" Don't feel old school vibe at all, maybe an old school 2000s internet flash game vibe.","sent_compound":0.5767999887466431,"sentiment_0_10":7.883999824523926,"sentiment_0_10_round":8,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:05.683Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"45628612","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198201233530","language":"english","last_played":"1680123806","num_reviews":"31","playtime_at_review":"128","playtime_forever":"128","received_for_free":false,"review":"..","sent_compound":0,"sentiment_0_10":5,"sentiment_0_10_round":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:03.196Z","voted_up":true,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"18712644","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198098985443","language":"english","last_played":"1445960680","num_reviews":"5","pla