94Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"2","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"19117586","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198083523024","language":"english","last_played":"1447697284","num_reviews":"89","playtime_at_review":"386","playtime_forever":"386","received_for_free":false,"review":"Remake of an old Polish trading game. While visually it is ok, gameplay is rather unpolished.\nBut ultimately it does not matter because the game is broken an unplayable for most people, due to the saving bug where you are only able to do so once on every of the available three save slot... and never again.\n\nWhile the developers were quick to respond to anyone that had complains on the game not being 16-bit despite it being in the title (with the same copy-paste response every time,) once the people started complaining about the save bug, they quickly disappeared from the forums, and still, many months after, they are nowhere to be seen (not even responding to the e-mails.)\n\nI wish I could refund it, but I didn't notice the bug until it was already too late for me.\nIt's a waste of money even on the sale. Now I'm making it a point to never buy anything from this developer.","sent_compound":-0.2870999872684479,"sentiment_0_10":3.564500093460083,"sentiment_0_10_round":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:05.839Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"1","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"21589384","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198152189918","language":"english","last_played":"1439585998","num_reviews":"3","playtime_at_review":"439","playtime_forever":"439","received_for_free":false,"review":"I played this game for a bit and ran into a lot of problems.\n\nFirst, the game is almost entirely dependant on luck, and the player has little control over what actually happens. If you're lucky in the beginning you might be able to do well. If not, you will have to restart. I had to restart about a dozen times. Even when you are doing well you might still fall victim to bad luck and have to go back to another save (if you're able to save at all).  \n\nThe game becomes repetitive quickly. \n\n Perhaps the most important problem I had is that my game would not save. I would be doing well after a while, but if I went to save my game it wouldn't save.","sent_compound":0.9502999782562256,"sentiment_0_10":9.751500129699707,"sentiment_0_10_round":10,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:05.185Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"29417926","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198136762705","language":"english","last_played":"1485079093","num_reviews":"16","playtime_at_review":"948","playtime_forever":"951","received_for_free":false,"review":"This game is hard so go read some guides first and download the table for merchandice prices before venturing out there hoping to make profits. At first you are struggling even to survive. Since they fixed bugs and achievements this game is actually playable.","sent_compound":0.3612000048160553,"sentiment_0_10":6.806000232696533,"sentiment_0_10_round":7,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:04.281Z","voted_up":true,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"1","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"19279234","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198192642190","language":"english","last_played":"1445550072","num_reviews":"1","playtime_at_review":"20","playtime_forever":"20","received_for_free":false,"review":"The game is honestly boring and not particularly engaging; the mechanics and the graphics aren't very good either and it's really not worth purchase.","sent_compound":-0.6273000240325928,"sentiment_0_10":1.8634999990463257,"sentiment_0_10_round":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:05.777Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"38685330","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198093242946","language":"english","last_played":"1722723632","num_reviews":"73","playtime_at_review":"8","playtime_forever":"15","received_for_free":false,"review":"Confusing and slow","sent_compound":-0.22630000114440918,"sentiment_0_10":3.868499994277954,"sentiment_0_10_round":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:03.508Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"22811495","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198112866114","language":"english","last_played":"1462456412","num_reviews":"342","playtime_at_review":"1551","playtime_forever":"1575","received_for_free":false,"review":"Review Updated (3/1/2018)\n\nThankfully the polish company http://games.forever-entertainment.com/ eventually woke from their drunken taverns and fixed a long standing issue with regards to broken achievements since the games release. They also tinkered with a known save file issue which was causing them occasionally not to work. While their customer service was slower than a Monday at a pub, many our thankful that it at least eventually happened.\n\nThere are a LOT of negative reviews despite the fact that a lot of time and effort has already been put into this game by the designers to make the graphics eye pleasing and the delightful background sound that accompanies the adventure to be very fitting indeed. So why then all the negative reviews? It boils down to a number of things...\n\n1) Gamers waited several years for them to fix five broken achievements and a corrupt save file issue. \n\n2) Developers still never responded to the customers personally or in the forums. This means that you might as well pull out your favourite teddy bear in your room and go to town on him/her venting all your frustration as you will more likely get a listening ear from it than you will from the customer service of this company. I guess partly broken game and never responding developers is what they mean when they call their company 'FOREVER entertainment'...\n\n3) The game itself was designed to be a 'trading game'. IT ISNT! It’s more a save your game every five seconds because the thieves are coming to take everything you own. In game it doesn't matter what you do, the thieves will steal everything you have built up in no time whatsoever. In fact it is so frustrating I'm not sure why they put them in at all. Take the thieves and kraken out of the game and the game has some merit to it, and it wouldn't matter at all the fact that the save files don't work for many people. As I said it doesn't matter what you do, you can have an army of 3,000 people and the 2 thieves will still take everything. For this reason there is no point at all to learn any trading strategies to play this game instead you will have to fleece the game in another way to win.\n\nFor those that have purchased this game, this is how to win.\n\nAs soon as you appear go to pub buy a 1 gold coin drink for all 3 customers until one offers you a treasure map. Go hire about 5 -7 people at the pub. Go sell the two diamonds you already have at the bank. Now travel to the closest mine. Search the mine and you should get a handful of diamonds. SAVE GAME. Travel back to the start. Fire the seven people at the pub. Sell the diamonds you have at the bank. IGNORE all markets. SAVE GAME. Slowly travel down to the bottom of the map to Lousifa or Zannadar IGNORING all the markets. You can buy drinks at pubs for the customers to get treasure maps or perform side quests. You can only do 3 side quests at any given time, you have to complete one to get another one. Once you’re at one of the two places mentioned above. Hire as many people as you can afford knowing there is going to be some travel expense. You should be able to still get quite a few maybe 50 people. Once you have them SAVE, travel to the closest mine, search the mine, go back to the town you have come from, fire all the people at the pub and then go to the bank and sell all the diamonds you have collected. SAVE GAME. Roam around for a handful of turns doing side quests and buying drinks and then repeat that process again at one of the two places mentioned. Congratulations that's it you have beaten the game.\n\nIt's just very tedious hiring and firing people, but using that above strategy you will get about 15,000 diamonds and win the game in about half an hour meaning you don't have to learn trading at all because it will never help you.\n\nIn a nutshell, a long time once broken game, non-existent customer service, rage quitting unfair events in the game that thwart every progress you have made and a game that complete misses the mark of being a trading game which it was originally intended to be and advertised as, makes this game a FOREVER THUMBS DOWN!\n\nBelow is a sample of someone else's recent play through...\n\nhttps://youtu.be/9bQOcS9lV_w\n\nIf you enjoyed reading this review please subscribe to my curator page. Thanks...\n\nhttp://store.steampowered.com/curator/6843548/","sent_compound":0.7156000137329102,"sentiment_0_10":8.57800006866455,"sentiment_0_10_round":9,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:04.809Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"3","votes_up":"19","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"19062898","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198010851018","language":"english","last_played":"1463622194","num_reviews":"13","playtime_at_review":"59","playtime_forever":"274","received_for_free":false,"review":"Gave this game 59 minutes of my life. Couldn't stand it for another minute.\n\nTurning a profit on trade goods is possible, but slow. Between purchasing costs and travel costs, you might ultimately make 50 coins per sale. However, there's a chance you'll be robbed along the way and lose anything from 10-50% of your coins/cargo. I managed to get myself up to about 1200 coins while doing some runs, and lost 500 from one robbery. I thought I had also been saving in every city, just in case a situation like this came up, but apparently the game wasn't actually saving. Lost about 5-10 minutes worth of game play.\n\nWhich, again, would not be a normal issue for most games. But this game is so slow and mindnumbing. It's not even a good spreadsheet simulator, as the prices rise and fall at random.\n\nTL;DR - Only buy this game for the trading cards.","sent_compound":0.6103000044822693,"sentiment_0_10":8.05150032043457,"sentiment_0_10_round":8,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:05.870Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false},{"rec_id":"34061258","appid":"375460","author_id":"76561198203968019","language":"english","last_played":"1476204123","num_reviews":"14","playtime_at_review":"26","playtime_forever":"29","received_for_free":false,"review":"Terrible game, not worth paying for!!!","sent_compound":-0.6850000023841858,"sentiment_0_10":1.5750000476837158,"sentiment_0_10_round":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-14T15:12:03.692Z","voted_up":false,"votes_funny":"0","votes_up":"0","written_during_early_access":false}]